OL,3,CWhy is looking directly at a solar
OL,4,Ceclipse dangerous?
OL,6,FDoctors discovered retinal damage that
OL,7,Fcorresponded to the eclipse's shape.
OL,9,F"The dark spot she was describing was
OL,10,Fin the shape of a crescent," said Dr.
OL,11,FAvnish Deobhakta, a Mount Sinai
OL,12,Fophthalmologist.
OL,14,FThere's no set rule for how long of a
OL,15,Fglance can lead to permanent damage.
OL,16,FSeverity varies based on cloudiness,
OL,17,Fair pollution and a person's vantage
OL,18,Fpoint.
