OL,3,CWhy is looking directly at a solar
OL,4,Ceclipse dangerous?
OL,6,FBut doctors say looking at a solar
OL,7,Feclipse for even a few seconds
OL,8,Funprotected isn't worth the risk.
OL,10,FHow can you watch it safely?
OL,12,FBell, a planetarium astronomer at the
OL,13,FRGO, said it is important to come
OL,14,Fprepared to watch the solar eclipse on
OL,15,FWednesday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
