OL,3,CWhy is looking directly at a solar
OL,4,Ceclipse dangerous?
OL,6,FThe maximum point of coverage is
OL,7,Fexpected to be at around 7.13pm.
OL,9,FBell advised getting to a vantage
OL,10,Fpoint facing west, with minimal
OL,11,Fbuildings around, as the best way to
OL,12,Fview the eclipse.
OL,14,FTo see where and when is the best time
OL,15,Fto watch it in the UK, click here
